WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Hi everyone. Meet Petal, a small, fluffy companion for your desk. She is designed for those moments when work feels overwhelming, your energy is low, or you just need a little company. This website lets you try that experience.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
First, here's a quick look at the product idea.

00:00:37.005 --> 00:00:46.005
Back on the website, you can give Petal a little pat and get a playful response.

00:00:46.005 --> 00:01:00.005
You can also check in with your human battery. For example, if you choose "Overwhelmed," the preview offers a gentle response and suggests taking one breath first.

00:01:00.005 --> 00:01:16.005
Petal is also a work buddy. Pick one small task and start a twenty-five-minute focus session. You can pause whenever you need to.

00:01:16.005 --> 00:01:25.005
For a softer reset, there's a one-minute breathing exercise.

00:01:25.005 --> 00:01:34.005
And Little Notes gives you a place to leave ideas or thoughts for later.

00:01:34.005 --> 00:01:47.005
The interface switches between English and Chinese. In the local prototype, you can also talk to Petal and hear her reply.

00:01:47.005 --> 00:02:00.541
Our next step is to bring this experience into a physical, furry companion. The aim is simple: a little focus, a little laughter, and a little less feeling alone.
